{"id":"fb76a370ebde152b","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-error-correcting-code.md","title":"Hamming Distance and Error Correcting Codes","display":"df-error-correcting-code — Hamming Distance and Error Correcting Codes","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-error-correcting-code","aliases":["28-df-error-correcting-code"],"type":"definition","display":"df-error-correcting-code — Hamming Distance and Error Correcting Codes","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 19.5 and 19.9","source_printed_pages":"380,382","source_pdf_pages":"406,408","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-error-correcting-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-error-correcting-code</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"display","html":"df-error-correcting-code — Hamming Distance and Error Correcting Codes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 19.5 and 19.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"380,382"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"406,408"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Sigma\">\\(A,\\Sigma\\)</span> 为至少含两个元素的有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E:A^n\\to\\Sigma^m\">\\(E:A^n\\to\\Sigma^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\delta\\in[0,1]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的字按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\">\\([m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\)</span> 编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in\\Sigma^m\">\\(u,v\\in\\Sigma^m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式允许消息字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与输出字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 不同；取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\Sigma\">\\(A=\\Sigma\\)</span> 恢复原书定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(u,v)\\coloneqq\\frac1m\\left|\\{i\\in[m]:u_i\\ne v_i\\}\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(u,v)\\coloneqq\\frac1m\\left|\\{i\\in[m]:u_i\\ne v_i\\}\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E;\\delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a,b\\in A^n\\ \\left(a\\ne b\\Longrightarrow\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(E(a),E(b))\\ge\\delta\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E;\\delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a,b\\in A^n\\ \\left(a\\ne b\\Longrightarrow\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(E(a),E(b))\\ge\\delta\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Codewords}(E)\\coloneqq\\{E(a):a\\in A^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Codewords}(E)\\coloneqq\\{E(a):a\\in A^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A^n:\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(E(a),y)\\le\\rho\\}\\qquad(y\\in\\Sigma^m,\\ \\rho\\in[0,1]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A^n:\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(E(a),y)\\le\\rho\\}\\qquad(y\\in\\Sigma^m,\\ \\rho\\in[0,1]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definitions 19.5、19.9（印刷380、382页/PDF406、408页）按不同消息的输出距离给出 ECC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 是距离的下界，并不声称一定等于最小距离。半径候选集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是本地显式集合缩写，供唯一译码及列表界复用；它本身不承诺存在高效算法。有限集合的基数和有限集合分离使所有构造良定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta=0\">\\(\\delta=0\\)</span> 允许非单射编码，与原书字面定义一致；唯一恢复节点另要求正距离。不同消息/输出字母表是为原书§19.2.5级联构造作出的直接类型推广。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"E:A^n\\to\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(u,v)\\coloneqq\\frac1m\\left|\\{i\\in[m]:u_i\\ne v_i\\}\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E;\\delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a,b\\in A^n\\ \\left(a\\ne b\\Longrightarrow\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(E(a),E(b))\\ge\\delta\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Codewords}(E)\\coloneqq\\{E(a):a\\in A^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A^n:\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(E(a),y)\\le\\rho\\}\\qquad(y\\in\\Sigma^m,\\ \\rho\\in[0,1]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta=0","display":false}],"bytes":1921,"backlinks":[{"id":"c980af2d105cc55b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,\\Sigma,n,m,E$ 与候选消息集合 $\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)$ 采用 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]；$\\rho\\in[0,1]$，$L\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"a58fab71e26cf742","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}$，$E_m:\\Sigma^{n(m)}\\to\\Sigma^m$，$\\rho\\in[0,1]$；$\\Delta_m^\\Sigma$ 采用 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。"},{"id":"d361a187ee93c869","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}$，$E_m:\\{0,1\\}^{n(m)}\\to\\{0,1\\}^m$。$D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}$，$\\langle a\\rangle$ 沿用 [[28-df-local-decoder]] 的单比特串记号；$o_D^y$、$\\tau_D^y$、$\\operatorname{bin}$、$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$、$\\nu$ 采用 [[28-df-local-decoder]]；$D^y(m,i,j;r)$、$T_D^y(m,i,j;r)$ 由下式定义，$r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}$；$\\rho\\in[0,1)$ 是本谓词的固定可处理半径，$\\epsilon=1-\\rho>0$。算法 $D$ 可专门化该固定参数；运行时输入只有以标准二进制编码的 $m,i,j$，$\\rho,\\epsilon$ 不作为额外机器输入。距离见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。"},{"id":"2fa56b15b1b02b78","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_m^F$、$\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}$ 见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"},{"id":"4beb5057b658d9d9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ECC}_